  "name": "Planning Applications",
  "description": "This dataset contains planning applications in the London Borough of Camden dating back to 01/01/2010. Planning application extents are captured against the OS MasterMap product, due to licensing restrictions with this product, this dataset is represented as point geometry, located to the nearest postcode (derived from the OS Code-Point Open product). Attribution includes application number, development address, development description, registered date, decision date and case officer.",
